    "collapsible_content_HA7hTA": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible_row_bdwWYh": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What is RS1?",
            "icon": "lightning_bolt",
            "row_content": "<p>RS1 is Reviv's sport mouthguard — designed to keep your bite unlocked while exercising and playing sports so that you reap the biomechanical benefits of that.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_b3Aq6U": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How is RS1 different from R1, R2, or R3?",
            "icon": "lightning_bolt",
            "row_content": "<p>R1, R2, and R3 are designed for nighttime wear and have channels for both upper and lower teeth.  They are a bit bulky whereas RS1 is smaller and thus  easier to use during the day.  RS1 also has ledges for the bottom teeth but is completely flat on top.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_46p3KR": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Does RS1 require any molding or fitting?",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>No molding required. RS1 is ready to use straight out of the box — just fit it in and train.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_wYPXBk": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What sports is RS1 designed for?",
            "icon": "lightning_bolt",
            "row_content": "<p>RS1 is built for playing sports, exercising, etc.  In general it keeps the upper and lower teeth separated without locking the bite, which has positive biomechanical impacts in our view.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_zHYD8j": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can I wear RS1 all day?",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>RS1 is meant to be used more for athletic use — gym sessions, classes, sport, and active daily movement. But it can also be used as a normal daytime mouthguard like RD1 (RevivDay).  But given that RD1 molds to the lower teeth and RS1 doesn't, RS1 is likely not as comfortable as a casual wear day guard as RD1.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_RaENdr": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How do I clean RS1?",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Rinse with cold water before and after each use. For a deeper clean, use a soft toothbrush with mild soap. Avoid hot water — it can distort the shape. You can also use Repod for a thorough clean.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_VrBWRK": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What is the appliance made out of?",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>RS1 is made from EVA + PP (Ethylene-Vinyl Acetate + Polypropylene) which is safe for daily athletic use.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
